  "body": "[GEMglPolygonMode] calls glPolygonMode() each time a gemlist passes through it, with the parameters set by its creation arguments and inlets. Its creation arguments also take GL constants by name; its inlets only take their values. See glPolygonMode in the OpenGL reference."
